go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-29-k8s%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%E6%80%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6-cri-cni-csi-deviceplugin-scheduler-crd/</guid><description>重要 Kubernetes 核心只做编排——调度、声明式 API、状态协调。容器的运行时、网络、存储、GPU、调度策略、自定义 API，全部通过扩展机制交给外部插件。</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>CNI</category><category>CSI</category><category>CRI</category><category>DevicePlugin</category><category>CRD</category><category>Operator</category><category>Scheduler</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s基石</category></item></channel></rss>